  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ech_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -284
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Echo trails\n\nA star swings round a Lissajous path. Echo (`echo` mode) keeps the last frames on the GPU and draws ten earlier ones under it, three frames apart, each fainter.\n\nTry `trails` (a fading smear), `delay`, `slit-scan` (each row from a different moment) or `freeze`.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Echo trails\n\nA star swings round a Lissajous path. Echo (`echo` mode) keeps the last frames on the GPU and draws ten earlier ones under it, three frames apart, each fainter.\n\nTry `trails` (a fading smear), `delay`, `slit-scan` (each row from a different moment) or `freeze`.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 220
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "et_t",
      "defType": "time/seconds",
      "position": {
        "x": 263,
        "y": 42
      },
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "et_ring",
      "defType": "spread/ring",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 202
      },
      "params": {
        "count": 10,
        "radius": 46
      },
      "portValues": {
        "count": 10,
        "radius": 46
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "et_star",
      "defType": "math/expression",
      "position": {
        "x": 221,
        "y": 164
      },
      "params": {
        "expr": "vec2(p.x, p.y) * (1 - 0.5 * (index % 2))"
      },
      "portValues": {}
